      "review_description": "The experience from start to finish was seamless and professional. JE Electrical organized everything with the supply authority, they were punctual and completed the installation of an 8 kw system in one day. The installation is extremely neat and well finished, all labelling and diagrams are neat and well presented. Jake took the time to explain the inverter and the wireless interface and the unit was up and running when they left for the day.I arranged the finance for the installation through the Tas Government finance scheme and this was vey simple and Jake was able to guide me through the process. Couldn't be happier, highly recommend JE Electrical for all Electrical and Solar work.The installation has been operating for almost 12 months and have no issues and the savings are fantastic",
